WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.520
eRanker ranks your Etsy listing on page one

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:05.880
for the keywords you choose, organically.

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:09.680
No ads, no SEO work, and no login to your shop.

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:13.600
It's built by Etsy sellers for Etsy sellers.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.960
And it's not about just one keyword.

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:18.320
Buyers search in different ways.

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:20.080
The same name necklace can be found

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:23.080
as a personalized name necklace,

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:26.400
a gold necklace for her, or a Mother's Day gift.

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:29.600
Your first step is a ranking test.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:32.760
One listing, one keyword.

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:36.880
It's proof that ranking works, not a sales plan.
